 <iati-activity default-currency="EUR" hierarchy="2" humanitarian="0" iati-activities:version="2.03" xml:lang="EN" xmlns:iati-activities="http://d-portal.org/xmlns/iati-activities">
  <iati-identifier>XI-IATI-EC_INTPA-2023-PC-32929</iati-identifier>
  <reporting-org ref="XI-IATI-EC_INTPA" secondary-reporter="0" type="15">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">European Commission - Directorate-General for International Partnerships</narrative>
  </reporting-org>
  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Technical assistance to support beneficiaries of the Boosting Food Production in Rwanda (KUNGAHARA) program to soundly implement their respective actions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);&quot;&gt;The boosting food production in Rwanda (Kungahara) call for proposals was part of the Commission Decision package on the financing of the special measures for the EU response to the food security crisis and economic shock in African, Caribbean and Pacific (ACP) countries following Russia&apos;s war of aggression against Ukraine. The priority of the call is to promote actions aiming at enhancing food production and availability by Rwandan local producers. Following the launch of the call early 2023, 14 actions have been selected for an overall amount of EUR 9 467 063. To ensure sound technical and financial implementation of the Kungahara program by beneficiaries, the EU Delegation to Rwanda is mobilizing a Technical Assistance.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class=&quot;ql-align-justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);&quot;&gt;The global objective of the TA is to enhance capacities of Kungahara call beneficiaries, ensuring overall sound planning, implementation, monitoring and reporting.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);&quot;&gt;Specific objectives;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ol&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);&quot;&gt;Support the beneficiaries in the technical and financial management of the actions, particularly in order to comply with EU contractual requirements and procedures for grants outlined under the Practical Guide and Financial Regulation.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);&quot;&gt;Support the beneficiaries with the EU monitoring and reporting requirements, both at technical and financial level.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li data-list=&quot;ordered&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ql-ui&quot; contenteditable=&quot;false&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(64, 64, 64);&quot;&gt;Ensure smooth communication between the Delegation of the European Union and the projects&#xbf; beneficiaries.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ol&gt;</narrative>
  </description>
